t[8913]={d="Hail, $c!  I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world.  Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.$B$BPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.$B$BI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus.  Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",o="오그리마에 있는 모크바르에게 실리시드 독 견본 15개와 20골드를 자연의정수 팔보호구 1개와 함께 가져가야 합니다."}
