t[9007]={d="A truly amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="모크바르에게 자연의정수 두건과 자연의정수 조끼를 주어야 합니다."}
